# Facio domain

`packages/domain` is the gold law. Keep it pure: no I/O, no network, no model.

- A cue without `surface` is rejected here, not in the UI.
- Drift and reminder time are arithmetic. Do not call an LLM from this package.
- Fixtures in `packages/domain/fixtures` are shared with the Swift client. Changing them without updating client tests is a release hole.
- Read `.cursor/skills/facio-product/SKILL.md` if a change touches product meaning.
